                "text": "In the Washington state Senate, I  helped lead bi-partisan efforts to create new medical schools and REDUCE the cost of college tuition by 20%. As a member of the Foreign Affairs Committee and Vice Chair of the House Sub-Committee on Higher Education, I\u2019m thrilled to announce that my first bill in Congress will be this important effort to help ensure that nefarious foreign actors aren\u2019t manipulating and subverting America\u2019s universities.\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
