                "text": "Thank you to the organizers of the Memorial Day at both Liberty Lake and the Vet Cemetery in Medical Lake for inviting me to speak at today\u2019s wonderful ceremonies. Big shout out to Honor Flight and Rotary for all they do to support America\u2019s best! Land of the Free, because of the Brave. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
