                "text": "Today\u2019s bill is a big WIN for veterans in Eastern Washington and nationwide! Fully funding VA healthcare and strengthening transportation access isn\u2019t just good policy, it's how we honor the promises made to those who served.\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
