                "text": "Last week, I had a great tour of Whitman Hospital & Medical Center with CEO Hank Hannigan, CFO Bill Bryant, and their incredible team. I was truly impressed by the staff\u2019s dedication to delivering top-notch, efficient care to the community! https://t.co/C0KS58EIoJ",
